WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.513 --> 00:00:03.793
<v Speaker 1>Speaker 1: He hoped there would be stew
for dinner, turnips and carrots

2
00:00:03.793 --> 00:00:06.513
<v Speaker 1>and bruised potatoes and fat mutton pieces

3
00:00:06.513 --> 00:00:10.473
<v Speaker 1>to be ladled out in thick,
peppered, flour fattened sauce.

4
00:00:10.753 --> 00:00:15.793
<v Speaker 2>Speaker 2: Also a popular contrivance
whereby love making may be suspended,

5
00:00:15.793 --> 00:00:19.273
<v Speaker 2>but not stopped, during the picnic season.

6
00:00:19.713 --> 00:00:20.713
<v Speaker 2>Hoorang…

7
00:00:21.793 --> 00:00:25.013
<v Speaker 1>Speaker 1: Stuff it into you,
his belly counselled him.

8
00:00:35.552 --> 00:00:37.992
<v Speaker 1>Hullo, Bertie any good in your mind?

9
00:00:38.352 --> 00:00:39.632
<v Speaker 1>Number ten.

10
00:00:39.632 --> 00:00:42.112
<v Speaker 1>Fresh Nelly is waiting on you.

11
00:00:42.112 --> 00:00:43.112
<v Speaker 2>Speaker 2: Pain

12
00:00:43.312 --> 00:00:45.592
<v Speaker 2>Painful to hear.

13
00:00:46.032 --> 00:00:47.712
<v Speaker 2>Hay fever.

14
00:00:47.712 --> 00:00:49.632
<v Speaker 1>Speaker 1: Good night, husband.

15
00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:53.992
<v Speaker 2>Speaker 2: A heart trouble caused
by falling in love with a grass widow.

16
00:00:54.592 --> 00:00:55.712
<v Speaker 2>Heaven!

17
00:00:55.712 --> 00:00:58.272
<v Speaker 2>A good place to be raised to.

18
00:00:58.272 --> 00:01:00.000
<v Speaker 1>Speaker 1: The music came nearer and he.

